      ⍝ Regression (Blake McBride, Bugs22 #6): ⎕JSON accepted raw
      ⍝ (unescaped) control characters U+0000..U+001F inside a JSON
      ⍝ string, which RFC 8259 §7 forbids.
      ⍝
      ⎕JSON ('["a',(⎕UCS 10),'b"]')
DOMAIN ERROR+
      ⎕JSON('["a',(⎕UCS 10),'b"]')
      ^
      )SIC

      ⎕JSON '["ab"]'
 ab 
